  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet avser kunskaps&#xF6;verf&#xF6;ring mellan avdelningen f&#xF6;r barn- och ungdomshabilitering i &#xD6;rnsk&#xF6;ldsvik genom Lunconsult Ab till  Archangelsk stad coh syftar till att utveckla habiliteringen ev funktionshindrade barn i regionen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at a transfer of knowledge in the social sector and is a cooperation between the municipality of Arkhangelsk and the department for child and youth habilitation in &#xD6;rnsk&#xF6;ldsvik through Lunconsult AB. The aim is to develop the habilitation of handicapped children in the region of Arkhangelsk.</narrative>
  </description>
